{
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "c1_trial",
   "title": "The Agility Trial",
   "bg": "school_arena",
   "lines": [
    {
     "cmd": "music",
     "id": "school"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "Nexa Academy's combat arena. The stands are full. The rankings screen glows above the floor."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "professor",
     "e": "normal",
     "p": "center"
    },
    {
     "s": "professor",
     "e": "normal",
     "t": "First-years! Today's trial measures agility and speed. Results are recorded on your permanent rank."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide",
     "c": "professor"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "kade",
     "e": "happy",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "s": "kade",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "Hey, Parker! Want a head start? Like… a ten-minute head start?"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "bruce",
     "e": "normal",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "normal",
     "t": "Leave him, Kade. Watching him try is funnier."
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "Bruce Kaizer. The strongest student in the academy. Leader of Frostfire Dominion. When he smiles, people step back."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide_all"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "serious",
     "t": "Breathe. Just finish the course. That's all.",
     "think": true
    },
    {
     "cmd": "competition",
     "id": "agility_trial",
     "win": "trial_done",
     "lose": "trial_done",
     "place": 1
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "trial_done"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "bg",
     "id": "school_arena",
     "tr": "none"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "The results flash on the screen. Kade first. Bruce second. And at the very bottom, as always—"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "zip",
     "e": "happy",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "s": "zip",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "PARKER, LAST PLACE! AGAIN! Somebody frame it!"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "Laughter rolls down from the stands."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "peter",
     "e": "sad",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "sad",
     "t": "Son of the No. 1 hero. Last again.",
     "think": true
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "professor",
     "e": "serious",
     "p": "center"
    },
    {
     "s": "professor",
     "e": "serious",
     "t": "Settle down. Mr. Parker — your time was better than last term."
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "normal",
     "t": "…Thank you, Professor."
    }
   ],
   "next": "c1_john",
   "chain": true,
   "transition": "fade",
   "location": "school_arena"
  },
  {
   "id": "c1_john",
   "title": "The New Student",
   "bg": "school_corridor",
   "lines": [
    {
     "cmd": "slot",
     "n": 1
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "After class. The east corridor — Frostfire Dominion territory."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "dex",
     "e": "happy",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "s": "dex",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "So you're the new kid with the copy power? Go on. Copy me. I dare you."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "john",
     "e": "surprised",
     "p": "center"
    },
    {
     "s": "john",
     "e": "surprised",
     "t": "I-I can't copy unless I touch— I mean, it only lasts a minute—"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "bruce",
     "e": "normal",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "normal",
     "t": "A copier. Useful. You'll copy for us from now on, new kid. Starting with your lunch money."
    },
    {
     "s": "john",
     "e": "sad",
     "t": "Please, I just want to get to class…"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide",
     "c": "bruce"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "serious",
     "t": "Walk away. Everyone walks away. It's what you always do.",
     "think": true
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "angry",
     "t": "…No. Not this time.",
     "think": true
    },
    {
     "choice": [
      {
       "t": "Step between Bruce and John.",
       "goto": "j_step",
       "rel": {
        "john": {
         "respect": 5
        }
       },
       "remember": {
        "john": "peter_stepped_in"
       }
      },
      {
       "t": "Shout \"Professor Hale is coming!\" — then step in.",
       "goto": "j_shout",
       "rel": {
        "john": {
         "trust": 3
        }
       }
      },
      {
       "t": "\"Hey Bruce — didn't you fail the history test? Need a tutor?\"",
       "goto": "j_tease",
       "rel": {
        "bruce": {
         "rivalry": 8
        },
        "john": {
         "friendship": 3
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "j_shout"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "serious",
     "t": "Professor Hale's coming this way!"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "bruce",
     "e": "serious",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "serious",
     "t": "Nice try. Hale's in the staff room. I can sense where everyone is before I teleport, Parker."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "goto",
     "label": "j_step"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "j_tease"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "bruce",
     "e": "angry",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "angry",
     "t": "What did you just say?"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "j_step"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "peter",
     "e": "serious",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "serious",
     "t": "Leave him alone, Bruce."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "bruce",
     "e": "surprised",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide",
     "c": "dex"
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "surprised",
     "t": "…The powerless kid has a voice? I almost respect it."
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "angry",
     "t": "Almost."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "sfx",
     "id": "hit"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "shake"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "Bruce vanishes — and reappears behind Peter. A frozen palm hits his back. The floor rushes up."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "peter",
     "e": "hurt",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "angry",
     "t": "Leave… him… alone."
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "Peter gets up. Bruce hits him again. Peter gets up again."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "professor",
     "e": "angry",
     "p": "center"
    },
    {
     "s": "professor",
     "e": "angry",
     "t": "KAIZER! Office. Now."
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "normal",
     "t": "Relax, Professor. We were just welcoming the new student. See you around, Parker."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide_all"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "john",
     "e": "sad",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "s": "john",
     "e": "sad",
     "t": "You didn't have to do that. You're bleeding…"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "peter",
     "e": "happy",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "I'm used to it. I'm Peter."
    },
    {
     "s": "john",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "John. John Reyes. I… nobody's ever stood up for me before."
    },
    {
     "s": "john",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "Okay. That's it. We're friends now. You can't take it back."
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "I wasn't going to."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "flag",
     "set": [
      "met_john",
      "met_bruce"
     ],
     "unset": []
    },
    {
     "cmd": "contact",
     "npc": "john"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "rel",
     "npc": "john",
     "add": {
      "friendship": 15,
      "trust": 10,
      "familiarity": 10
     },
     "remember": "peter_saved_me"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "rel",
     "npc": "bruce",
     "add": {
      "rivalry": 10
     }
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "FREE TIME: Use the Map to travel around Nexa, talk to people, train, work and shop. Time passes as you do activities. When the story is ready to continue, a gold button appears."
    }
   ],
   "next": "c2_announce",
   "chain": false,
   "transition": "fade",
   "location_after": "school_gate"
  }
 ]
}